<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_852_2369.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear> willig diennst. unnd was wir
<lb n="2"/>eeren liebs unnd guots vermoegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allezytt</unclear> bevor.
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">From</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersam</unclear> wyß insonnders guot
<lb n="4"/>fruendt unnd getruew lieb Eydtgnossen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> bur-
<lb n="5"/>ger <persName resp="#ner">Antony Stadler</persName>. bericht unns mit beschwaernuß.
<lb n="6"/>Nach dem er von wegen der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelten</unclear>. denen er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>schuldig. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Uffall</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewachßen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allso</unclear> das er ab-
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">traetten</unclear>. unnd von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uewer</unclear> statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abwychen</unclear> muessen.
<lb n="9"/>Welches <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> gantz schaedlich. dann so er darby unnd
<lb n="10"/>mitt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">koennde</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">man</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sinen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schuldnern</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rechnen</unclear>. unnd reytten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wuerde</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kound</unclear> er vil <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzei</unclear>-
<lb n="12"/>gen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Daduch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ettwaß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuorstand</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erübriget</unclear>. und
<lb n="13"/>die schulden all dester <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ee</unclear> bezalt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>. und
<lb n="14"/>deßhalb unns gantz <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnderthenig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gepaetten</unclear>. Ime
<lb n="15"/>gegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> mitt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürgschrifft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürzuerchiessen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">da</unclear>-
<lb n="16"/>mitt im ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fry</unclear> sicher gleit inn üwer statt ge-
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>. etc. Unnd so wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lewyen</unclear> inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinem</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annliggen</unclear> angehoert. und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verstanden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habent</unclear> wir
<lb n="19"/>ime <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weygern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear>. Unnd der-
<lb n="20"/>halb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ann</unclear> üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> gantz fründtlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begaeren</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>ir wellent dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uewern</unclear> Antony Stadler von un-
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sertt</unclear> wegen ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fry</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleit</unclear> geben unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuostellen</unclear>.
<lb n="23"/>damitt er mitt sinen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schulden</unclear> dester baß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halber</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rechnen</unclear>
