<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwallt</unclear> unnser aller herren und obren
<lb n="38"/>uff dem tag der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jarrachnung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> Baden
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> Ergoew <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versampt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>.
